<BaseLayout title="Terms"><section class="section"><div class="container legal"><p class="eyebrow">Terms</p><h1>Terms</h1><p class="lede">Menus, prices, hours and availability may change by location and time. Live operational data should be treated as the most current source, while final order/reservation terms are confirmed in the applicable transaction flow. A reviewed legal terms document should replace this placeholder before transactional launch.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.legal{display:grid;gap:24px}.legal h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem)}</style>
